                <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@bodhicai.tech?subject=Support%20Inquiry">support@bodhicai.tech</a></p>
                <p>Our support team typically responds within 24 hours.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Business Inquiries</h3>
                <p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@bodhicai.tech?subject=Business%20Inquiry">support@bodhicai.tech</a></p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Registered Address</h3>
                <p>BodhicAI Inc.<br />
                Bangalore, Karnataka<br />
                India</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h3>Grievance Officer</h3>
                <p>As per the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act (DPDPA), 2023</p>
                <p><strong>Name:</strong> Srikaran Golla</p>
                <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:grievance@bodhicai.tech">support@bodhicai.tech</a></p>
                <p><strong>Response Time:</strong> Within 48 hours of receiving the complaint</p>
